<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH REGIONAL UTILITY Q1GROSS CZK 134MLN.</title>
<headline>CZECH REGIONAL UTILITY Q1GROSS CZK 134MLN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for three</p>
<p>month period ending March 31 1997 (in millions of crowns).</p>
<p>			   Q1 1997		 Q1 1996</p>
<p> Gross profit	  133.863		 275.273</p>
<p> Operating profit    150.835		 262.165</p>
<p> Write offs	    144.751		 123.782</p>
<p>Revenues for</p>
<p>sale of</p>
<p>own goods </p>
<p> and services     2,411.775		2,525.563</p>
<p> Production	 2,421.686		2,536.478</p>
<p> Assets	     7,885.692		6,826.886</p>
<p> Basic capital    3,253.008		3,253.008</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Severoceska Energetika a.s. It</p>
<p>is a regional energy distributor.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
